sent and what team_key produces for \"Flamengo\".\n\nActually the issue: champion 2019 Brasileirao shows played 76 for Flamengo — that's because both Brasileirao_Matches.csv AND the historical (2003-2019) AND BR-Football-Dataset (Serie A) all match \"brasileirao\" substring? No, \"Brasileirao\" filter matches \"Brasileirao\" and \"Brasileirao (2003-2019)\" but not \"Serie A\". So 76 = double-counted seasons. Two sources for 2019? Brasileirao_Matches.csv starts 2012, and novo_campeonato ends 2019. So 2019 is in both → 76 matches (38*2). That's a duplicate problem.\n\nAlso Flamengo 2023 stats 0 - because Brasileirao_Matches.csv maybe uses \"Flamengo-RJ\" and team_key(\"Flamengo-RJ\") should equal team_key(\"Flamengo\"). Let me check.\n\nWait, actually 2023 might not be in Brasileirao_Matches.csv. Let me check seasons.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_eecdd3830001DhKy765xNUG2aj","sessionID":"ses_11326b3aaffebuPmo4MbnyTU6H","messageID":"msg_eecdd266d001ktN6xnRXApT77B"}}
